WEBVTT

00:04.000 --> 00:05.400
No matter what

00:05.520 --> 00:07.520
Can't treat the people like this

00:08.320 --> 00:09.640
Xie Xuan

00:09.720 --> 00:10.560
Here

00:10.640 --> 00:11.680
I order you

00:11.760 --> 00:13.360
At all costs

00:13.960 --> 00:15.320
Take the city tomorrow

00:15.480 --> 00:16.880
Yes

00:22.500 --> 00:30.500
Upon your command, Xie Xuan personally led troops to oversee the battle, storming Dongming at all costs. Cao Biaozhi resisted desperately and fell fighting within the city.

00:31.000 --> 00:39.500
Half a day later, Xie Xuan breached Dongming by sheer sacrifice of human lives. Yet your army suffered catastrophic casualties, and in private, the soldiers harbored deep grievances against your decision...

00:40.360 --> 00:42.040
Oh, quickly relay

